        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Dan Abnett, Andy Lanning\n- Organizations: Marvel Comics\n- Products: Guardians of the Galaxy (2008 team)\n- People: Groot, Star-Lord, Rocket Raccoon, Quasar, Adam Warlock, Gamora, Drax the Destroyer\n\nFacts:\n- Dan Abnett and Andy Lanning formed the Guardians of the Galaxy 2008 team from existing and previously unrelated characters created by various writers and artists.\n- The initial roster of the Guardians of the Galaxy 2008 team was Star-Lord, Rocket Raccoon, Quasar, Adam Warlock, Gamora, Drax the Destroyer, and Groot.\n- Groot is a fictional superhero appearing in American comic books published by Marvel Comics.",
